#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:1
msgid "First equipment, first tape-out, materials and software routes"
msgstr "首台套、首轮流片、首批次材料、首版次软件路径"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:4
msgid "Grant / market access | Citywide / global"
msgstr "补助与市场准入｜全市／全球"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:6
msgid "Published route; current call to confirm"
msgstr "路径已公布，现行申报待确认"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S113 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250411/7afb62949bac416386811c9c6cfaf655.html>`_. "
"市政府新闻发布会介绍《上海市促进专精特新中小企业发展壮大的若干措施》相关情况."
msgstr "`证据 S113 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250411/7afb62949bac416386811c9c6cfaf655.html>`_. 市政府新闻发布会介绍《上海市促进专精特新中小企业发展壮大的若干措施》相关情况."

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:13
msgid "Program-specific; no common award ceiling established"
msgstr "依具体项目确定，无统一资助上限"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:15
msgid "No equity for qualifying public support"
msgstr "合资格财政支持不占股"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:20
msgid ""
"Shanghai policy identifies these routes for qualifying specialized SMEs "
"and new products. Recognition, insurance compensation, procurement and "
"R&D support are separate mechanisms; obtain the current call."
msgstr "上海政策列出专精特新企业及创新产品相关路径。认定、保险补偿、采购与研发支持为不同机制，应索取现行申报通知。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:22
msgid "Track-specific notices"
msgstr "依赛道通知"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route <https://www.sheitc.sh.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://www.sheitc.sh.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/first-use.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
